# Firmware work

- Prefer a **new chat** for firmware; do not continue long hardware/KiCad threads.
- Point at one file or function; avoid “read the whole firmware”.
- Never Read/Grep `*.pdf`, `*.kicad_sch`, `_preview/*`, or layout PNGs. They are gitignored and cursorignored.
- Hardware v1.4 is frozen — GPIO map is in `docs/HARDWARE_V1.md` §10; do not redesign power here.
- Ask for Agent only when you want code edits; use Ask/cheap model for “how does X work?”.
